* `PJ.miL = forL 50 2 3 (8 := 0; PJ.tsL; PJ.miT)`: pushes `miV a u` for `u < n` on `SMI` (`Rn.miL`);
* `PJ.colL = forL 53 28 3 PJ.colB`: for each column `k < m`, `b = L[k]`, pushes
  `[a = b] 2^Q + Σ_y [gC y = b] gV y` on `SMAT = 43` (`Rn.colL`).
